{"task_id": "Mbpp/88", "solution": "def _validate_elements_hashable(input_list: list) -> None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Validates that all elements in the input list are hashable.\n    Raises TypeError if an unhashable element is found.\n    \"\"\"\n    for element in input_list:\n        try:\n            hash(element)\n        except TypeError:\n            raise TypeError(f\"Unhashable type found: {type(element)}\")\n\ndef freq_count(input_list: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the frequency of each element in a list, returning the result as a dictionary.\n    Ensures all elements are hashable and does not modify the input list.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_elements_hashable(input_list)\n    frequency_map = {}\n    for element in input_list:\n        frequency_map[element] = frequency_map.get(element, 0) + 1\n    return frequency_map"}
