{"task_id": "Mbpp/234", "solution": "def _is_numeric(value) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Internal helper to check whether a provided value is numeric (int or float), excluding booleans.\"\"\"\n    return isinstance(value, (int, float)) and not isinstance(value, bool)\n\ndef volume_cube(side_length):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the volume of a cube given its side length.\"\"\"\n    if not _is_numeric(side_length):\n        raise TypeError(\"side_length must be a numeric type (int or float)\")\n    result = side_length * side_length * side_length\n    return result"}
