{"task_id": "Mbpp/462", "solution": "def combinations_list(elements):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds all possible combinations (subsets) of the elements of a given list.\n    Generates combinations using binary bitmask iteration with input[0] as LSB.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(elements, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"elements must be a list\")\n\n    n = len(elements)\n    total_combinations = 1 << n  # Equivalent to 2**n\n    output_list = []\n\n    for i in range(total_combinations):\n        current_combination = []\n        for j in range(n):\n            if (i >> j) & 1:\n                current_combination.append(elements[j])\n        output_list.append(current_combination)\n\n    if len(output_list) != total_combinations:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"internal generation failure: cardinality mismatch\")\n\n    return output_list"}
