{"task_id": "Mbpp/742", "solution": "import math\n\nSQRT3 = math.sqrt(3)\n\ndef area_tetrahedron(a):\n    \"\"\"Compute and return the surface area of a regular tetrahedron given edge length a.\n    The surface area is computed as SQRT3 * a * a.\n    \"\"\"\n    surface_area = SQRT3 * a * a\n    return float(surface_area)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(lst, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates a list to the right by k positions, returning a new list.\n    Handles empty lists and ensures input list immutability.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not lst:\n        return []\n\n    n = len(lst)\n    r = k % n\n\n    if r == 0:\n        return lst.copy()\n    else:\n        return lst[-r:] + lst[:-r]"}
