{"task_id": "Mbpp/792", "solution": "def count_list(input: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of direct inner lists within a top-level list. Raises TypeError if the input or its elements do not meet the expected list types.\"\"\"\n    \n    if not isinstance(input, list):\n        raise TypeError('input must be a list of lists')\n    \n    for item in input:\n        if not isinstance(item, list):\n            raise TypeError('all elements must be lists')\n            \n    return len(input)"}
