{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tupleA, tupleB) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is strictly smaller than its corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    The function performs element-wise comparison and returns True if all elements in tupleB are strictly smaller.\n    \"\"\"\n    return all(b_val < a_val for a_val, b_val in zip(tupleA, tupleB))"}
